feat(email): outbound send-supplier-email endpoint with stub mode

Adds a Netlify function that sends supplier outreach emails via SendGrid
and logs them to contact_threads/contact_messages. Reply-To uses a
thread-<id>@replies.neurocann.app token so the inbound webhook can route
replies back to the right thread without header inference.

Supplier bodies are plain text with a minimal <p>/<br> HTML fallback,
no neurocann branding or CTA button, so they read as if a human sent
them. Stub mode (SENDGRID_API_KEY unset or 'stub') short-circuits the
send and lets unit tests exercise the DB path without network.

